comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T05:08:31.439Z",codex-sol,"Resumed regression suite passes against real HTTP, disposable PostgreSQL, and a scratch pm project (4/4). Preserved the interrupted implementation. Linked-test JSON also needed a single-entry array at the SDK dispatch boundary. Explicit persisted-record and bulk membership assertions pin the behavior."
